1937	// The scatter is laid on a fixed pixel grid (one jittered emoji per cell), not a
1938	// percentage cloud, so it never stretches: a wider region just gains more cells
1939	// at the same density. Positions/emoji are a deterministic hash of the cell
1940	// index + the region's seed, so it stays put across re-plans and a resize only
